---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const BRAND_NAME = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME ?? '{{BRAND_NAME}}';
const SITE_URL = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SITE_URL ?? 'https://yourdomain.com';
const supportEmail = `support@${new URL(SITE_URL).hostname}`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Terms of Service | ${BRAND_NAME}`}
  description={`Read the ${BRAND_NAME} Terms of Service. Learn about your rights and responsibilities when using our AI image generation platform.`}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-[#555] text-sm mb-12">Last updated: April 2025</p>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-sm max-w-none space-y-10 text-[#888] leading-relaxed">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using {BRAND_NAME} ("the Service") at {new URL(SITE_URL).hostname}, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">2. Description of service</h2>
        <p>{BRAND_NAME} provides an AI-powered image generation platform that allows users to generate photos in various styles, settings, and scenarios by uploading reference photos and entering text prompts. The Service includes web applications, subscription plans, and one-time credit packs.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">3. Eligibility</h2>
        <p>You must be at least 13 years old to use the Service. If you are under 18, you must have permission from a parent or legal guardian.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">4. Accounts</h2>
        <p>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account credentials and for all activity that occurs under your account. Notify us immediately at <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`} class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">{supportEmail}</a> if you suspect unauthorized access to your account.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">5. Credits and payments</h2>
        <p>The Service operates on a credit system. Credits are consumed when you generate images.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-3 space-y-2">
          <li><span class="text-white font-semibold">Subscription credits</span> reset each billing period. Unused subscription credits are forfeited at the end of each period and do not roll over.</li>
          <li><span class="text-white font-semibold">Top-up credits</span> purchased as one-time packs never expire and roll over indefinitely.</li>
          <li>All prices are displayed in USD. Payments are processed by Stripe.</li>
          <li>Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled before the renewal date.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">6. Refund policy</h2>
        <p>All purchases are non-refundable once any credits have been used. If you have not consumed any credits, you may request a refund by contacting <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`} class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">{supportEmail}</a> with your account email and order details.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">7. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to use the Service to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-3 space-y-2">
          <li>Generate images of real people without their explicit consent</li>
          <li>Create sexually explicit content involving minors under any circumstances</li>
          <li>Generate content that is defamatory, harassing, threatening, or incites violence</li>
          <li>Produce content intended to deceive, defraud, or impersonate others</li>
          <li>Violate any applicable law or regulation</li>
          <li>Circumvent technical limitations or access controls</li>
          <li>Use automated tools to scrape, crawl, or abuse the Service</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">8. Content ownership and license</h2>
        <p><span class="text-white font-semibold">Your uploads:</span> You retain ownership of all photos and content you upload to the Service. By uploading, you grant us a limited, non-exclusive license to process your content solely for the purpose of providing the Service to you.</p>
        <p class="mt-3"><span class="text-white font-semibold">Generated images:</span> Images generated by the Service are yours to use. All paid plans include a commercial use license.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">9. Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
        <p>The Service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or that generated images will meet your specific requirements.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">10. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, {BRAND_NAME} shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the Service. Our total liability to you shall not exceed the amount you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">11. Termination</h2>
        <p>You may cancel your account at any time through account settings. We may suspend or terminate your access to the Service at any time for violation of these terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">12. Changes to terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-3">13. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about these Terms of Service, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`} class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">{supportEmail}</a>.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
